title: Targeting our Enemies
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: targeting_timer = 6; week_actions += 1
view-if: targeting_timer <= 0 and (rg_banned = 0 or arditi_cooperation = 1)
frequency: 200
card-image: img/Targeting.jpg
tags: para_affairs
go-to: adp_menu if rg_banned = 1

= Targeting our Enemies

We are not acting alone. Even now, across the nation, the <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Fasci</span>, <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Arditismo</span> and <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Anti-Bolshevik Leagues</span> have their forces out, inciting violence, threatening voters, recruiting forces and the like. Fortunately, we can utilise our own paramilitary forces to combat them.

- @rg_fasci: Focus the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guard</span>'s efforts against the veteran <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Fasci Italiani di Combattimento</span>.
- @rg_arditi: Focus the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guard</span>'s efforts against the rural <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Arditismo</span>.
- @rg_abl: Focus the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guard</span>'s efforts against the urban <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Anti-Bolshevik Leagues</span>.
- @rg_keep: Keep the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guard</span> operating in the current scope.
- @easy_discard

@rg_fasci
on-arrival: fasci_rg_active = 1; arditi_rg_active = 0; abl_rg_active = 0;
view-if: fasci_rg_active = 0 and fasci_adp_active = 0
go-to: adp_menu if arditi_formed and arditi_cooperation

The <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guard</span> focuses its targets on the <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Fasci Italiani di Combattimento</span>, slowing down its growth and preventing it's intimidation tactics.

@rg_arditi  
on-arrival: arditi_rg_active = 1; fasci_rg_active = 0; abl_rg_active = 0;
view-if: arditi_rg_active = 0 and arditi_adp_active = 0
go-to: adp_menu if arditi_formed and arditi_cooperation

The <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guard</span> focuses its targets on the <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Arditismo</span>, slowing down its growth and preventing it's intimidation tactics on the rural populace.

@rg_abl  
on-arrival: abl_rg_active = 1; arditi_rg_active = 0; fasci_rg_active = 0;
view-if: abl_rg_active = 0 and abl_adp_active = 0
go-to: adp_menu if arditi_formed and arditi_cooperation

The <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guard</span> focuses its targets on the <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Anti-Bolshevik Leagues</span>, slowing down its growth and preventing it's intimidation tactics on the urban population.

@rg_keep
view-if: abl_rg_active = 1 or arditi_rg_active = 1 or fasci_rg_active = 1
go-to: adp_menu if arditi_formed and arditi_cooperation

